  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Oh
    nextNodeID: Flood
    text: "\u2026Oh. You\u2019re not from this villager are you? Sorry, I did not
      mean to respond to you that way. I\u2019ve just been\u2026 very tired."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Tekton
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Flood
    nextNodeID: Hilarious
    text: "After the damn flood, there\u2019s been too much work for me."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Tekton
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Hilarious
    nextNodeID: Empathy
    text: "\u2018Tekton! Fix our roof!\u2019. \u2018Tekton, repair the wall!\u2019.
      Ugh, I\u2019m tired of being in everyone\u2019s service. You also get that,
      right?"
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Tekton
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Empathy
    nextNodeID: choices0
    text: I mean, you are also a delivery man that has to run around by foot and
      bring goods to people.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Tekton
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: choices0
    nextNodeID: 
    text: 
    choices:
    - text: "I haven\u2019t been in this job for too long, but I get you. It is a
        highly demanding job."
      nextNodeID: Ah
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    - text: No, not really.
      nextNodeID: SoonEnough
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Ah
    nextNodeID: Envy
    text: "No one gets me better than you, my friend. It\u2019s.. truly heart warming."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Tekton
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: SoonEnough
    nextNodeID: Envy
    text: "Well, you\u2019ll get it soon enough. The reality will hit you at one
      point."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Tekton
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Envy
    nextNodeID: Clue
    text: You see those two love birds up in the village? I envy them. I wish I had
      a partner that I could share my life with, because, you know, we would be able
      to share our worries, right?
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Tekton
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Clue
    nextNodeID: Thanks
    text: "Anyways, enough complaints! I should go and fix up the damage in Lydos'
      storage. I don\u2019t know who made it, but it sure would have made at least
      a bruise on their end."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Tekton
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: Thanks
    nextNodeID: 
    text: Talking to you made me feel better, thanks.
